# Road & City Master is a separate product with its own repository.
# It must never enter this history. See § 10.39.
RoadCityMaster/
RoadCityMaster.meta
RoadArchitect-master/

# The art library is deliberately not in this history.
#
# 610 MB across 449 binary files -- 36 MB for a single tree LOD0 -- which every
# clone of a source repository would have to fetch in full, forever, because git
# stores each re-export of a mesh as a new blob rather than a delta. The models
# are also the one part of this folder whose redistribution terms are not this
# project's to assert, and a source history is the wrong place to make that
# assertion by accident.
#
# The scripts here reference the models by GUID, so the .meta files ARE tracked
# and the wiring survives; a checkout without Content/ opens with the prefabs
# unresolved and is repaired by restoring the folder, not by re-importing.
#
# The folder's OWN .meta is not tracked, for the same reason as the folder: a
# meta with no folder beside it is deleted by Unity on the next import, so
# tracking it only produces churn in every clone that does not have the art.
UniverseCreator/Content/
UniverseCreator/Content.meta

# Unity's own per-machine leftovers, in case the working copy is ever opened
# with the project root as the repository root rather than this folder.
*.csproj
*.sln
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.suo
*.unityproj
